<h1>Review changes to Unity assets</h1>
<p>
  PrefabLens shows changes to GameObjects, components, and fields in text-serialized Unity assets.
  Review diffs in GitHub pull requests, the terminal, or the Unity Editor. Use the CLI to merge conflicting assets.
</p>

