<h2 id="install"><a href="#install">Install</a></h2>

<h3 id="chrome-extension"><a href="#chrome-extension">Chrome extension</a></h3>
<p><a href="https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/dlhnalbfkikchkfedfneiimadommcnip">Chrome Web Store</a></p>
<p>Open a pull request's Files changed page on <code>github.com</code> and select <strong>Semantic</strong>. If prompted, sign in through the PrefabLens panel.</p>

<h3 id="cli"><a href="#cli">CLI</a></h3>
<p>Homebrew on macOS or Linux:</p>
<pre><code><span class="cmd">brew</span> install hashiiiii/tap/prefablens</code></pre>
<p>Scoop on Windows:</p>
<pre><code><span class="cmd">scoop</span> bucket add hashiiiii https://github.com/hashiiiii/scoop-bucket
<span class="cmd">scoop</span> install prefablens</code></pre>
<p>With mise:</p>
<pre><code><span class="cmd">mise</span> use -g github:hashiiiii/PrefabLens</code></pre>
<p>
  Or download your platform's ZIP from <a href="https://github.com/hashiiiii/PrefabLens/releases">GitHub Releases</a>.
  Extract it and add its directory to <code>PATH</code>.
  Run <code>prefablens</code> in your repository to compare <code>HEAD</code> with the working tree.
  See the <a href="https://github.com/hashiiiii/PrefabLens/blob/main/docs/cli.md">CLI guide</a> for commands and merge setup.
</p>

<h3 id="unity-editor"><a href="#unity-editor">Unity Editor</a></h3>
<p>Requires Unity 2022.3 or later. Install with OpenUPM:</p>
<pre><code><span class="cmd">openupm</span> add com.hashiiiii.prefablens</code></pre>
<p>Or use the Package Manager Git URL: <code>https://github.com/hashiiiii/PrefabLens.git?path=editor</code></p>

<p>Open <strong>Window &gt; PrefabLens</strong> to select a changed asset and review its diff.</p>
